5,1,1,talk,Victoria,,I am concerned about the human element. We must ensure we have the actual personnel to execute these plans.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Takumi,,We always forget why things failed before. I'm going to check the old records so we don't repeat the same mistakes.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Toshio,,I want to understand the administrative bottlenecks and the physical realities of the sites. Drawings often lie.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,I... I worry about the long-term costs. I want to see where the money is actually coming from.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Sakura,,"Hi everyone! I want to find out where people are actually wasting time, not just where they complain the most!","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Takumi, historical data is useful, but only if the current staffing levels can support the proposed changes.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Takumi,,Staffing is just a number if the plan is fundamentally flawed. We need to see what actually worked in the past.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"I agree with Takumi on history, but specifically regarding the physical constraints of the pre-war structures.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,"Um, if we don't check the ledger, we might just be arguing over numbers that aren't even there...","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Sakura,,"But if we fix the wrong thing, it's like putting a band-aid on a finger when your toe hurts!","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Victoria,,I will focus on the roster books and maintenance contracts. We cannot promise what we cannot staff.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Takumi,,I'm sticking to my guns. I'll look at the pilots from eight years ago and the accessibility records.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Toshio,,I will examine the joint operators' committee minutes and the contingency pricing for the pre-war shells.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,I think... I'll look at the capital ledger and the ticketing contractor fees. I hope that helps.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Sakura,,I'm going to be a detective! I'll check the journey audits and the timed runs and crowd counts!,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
