36,2,1,talk,Victoria,,My findings are worrying. The late-turn pool is exhausted. Any plan requiring more late-night operations is currently impossible.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Takumi,,"Actually, a late-evening pilot eight years ago worked perfectly. The problem isn't the plan; it's how you're managing the staff now.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Toshio,,The physical risks are higher than we thought. Work in the pre-war shells is a gamble. We should avoid those areas.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Daisuke,,I found some... ring-fenced funds in the capital ledger. We could use those without fighting over the main budget.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,1,talk,Sakura,,Guess what! The crowds aren't the real problem! People are spending way too much time just waiting for connections!,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Takumi, the staff from eight years ago are not the staff we have today. We cannot ignore the current deficit.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Takumi,,"Then fix the deficit! If we ignore a proven success just because we're lazy with rosters, we're failing the city.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Victoria, if we avoid the pre-war shells, we might avoid the need for those late-night emergency shifts you're worried about.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Daisuke,,I just... I don't want us to start fighting about the pots of money again. The ring-fenced funds are a safe bet.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,2,talk,Sakura,,"Exactly! Let's use that money to fix the waiting times! That's where the real ""lost minutes"" are hiding!","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Victoria,,I can agree to a plan that avoids the pre-war shells and doesn't add to the late-turn burden.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Takumi,,I'll support any plan that actually implements the successful elements of the previous pilots instead of inventing new ones.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Toshio,,I've also seen that roadway consents are already delegated. A plan focusing on surface improvements would be far more predictable.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Daisuke,,"If we use the ring-fenced construction balance, we won't have to cut the operating subsidy... right?","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,3,talk,Sakura,,"Yay! So we should pick the one that makes the connections faster, not just the one that makes the platforms look empty!","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
